  "img": "icons/magic/symbols/runes-star-pentagon-orange-purple.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your Speed increases by 10 feet, and you add 10 feet to your long jump distance and 3 feet to your high jump distance. Your hybrid form also gains the following benefit.</p>\n<p><strong>Improved Predatory Strikes.</strong> You gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls made with your Unarmed Strikes. This bonus increases to +2 at 11th level and to +3 at 18th level. In addition, while you have an active Crimson Rite on your Unarmed Strikes in hybrid form, those strikes count as Magical for the purpose of overcoming Resistance and Immunity to nonmagical attacks and damage.</p>",
